[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2461.309, "timestamp": "00:41:01", "text": "但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2463.67, "timestamp": "00:41:03", "text": "是啊，还有什么？我们还能是什么呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2465.67, "timestamp": "00:41:05", "text": "在说什么？抱歉，我当时正要走"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2467.95, "timestamp": "00:41:07", "text": "刚才说到那件事儿，有点跑题了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2470.95, "timestamp": "00:41:10", "text": "再次。抱歉，我思路被打断了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2474.069, "timestamp": "00:41:14", "text": "现在比以前更频繁了。喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2475.589, "timestamp": "00:41:15", "text": "这真是件很常见的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2478.87, "timestamp": "00:41:18", "text": "如今。我不知道我是不是就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2481.43, "timestamp": "00:41:21", "text": "因为我注意到我的记忆力也消失了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2483.19, "timestamp": "00:41:23", "text": "拉屎。我不知道那是不是只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2485.51, "timestamp": "00:41:25", "text": "就像一件平常事，但就像我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2487.67, "timestamp": "00:41:27", "text": "实际上，我最近一直在经历类似的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2490.309, "timestamp": "00:41:30", "text": "记忆丧失发作。超级随机"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2492.39, "timestamp": "00:41:32", "text": "记忆力衰退。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2493.91, "timestamp": "00:41:33", "text": "就像有些人可能会说的那样，“哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2495.589, "timestamp": "00:41:35", "text": "不，你只是单纯的健忘而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2498.79, "timestamp": "00:41:38", "text": "我当时想，“我甚至都不记得是什么了。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2502.47, "timestamp": "00:41:42", "text": "我今天早上就这么做了。” 因为就像，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2503.99, "timestamp": "00:41:43", "text": "糟糕，我竟然不记得是什么了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2510.069, "timestamp": "00:41:50", "text": "早晨。就像……就像……就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2512.309, "timestamp": "00:41:52", "text": "坏的。但我不知道这是否是真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2514.71, "timestamp": "00:41:54", "text": "我必须处理的问题。也许我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2516.43, "timestamp": "00:41:56", "text": "说实话，应该去检查一下。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2518.63, "timestamp": "00:41:58", "text": "我应该跟我的……提起这件事吗？"}]